      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT to understand the code before improving understandability.Now I understand the original test. The key understandability issues are:\n1. An unused helper method `tagSetNamespaceCount` that creates confusion about what the test needs\n2. Several unused imports (`Field`, `Map`, `AtomicInteger`, `Element`, `NamespaceHtml`)\n\nI'll write the improved test with those removed.The improved test compiles successfully. The refactored version removes the unused `tagSetNamespaceCount` helper method and its associated dead imports (`Field`, `Map`, `AtomicInteger`, `Element`, `NamespaceHtml`), and adds structured comments that clarify the three-step intent: register the customizer, parse the HTML, then assert the expected output."
